{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And he blessed him and said: Blessed be Avram to El Elyon.</b> First he blessed him, and afterward said: even apart from my blessing, Avram is blessed to El Elyon, as He said (Genesis 12:2), וַאֲבָרֶכְךָ." "<b>Possessor of heaven and earth.</b> The heaven and the earth are a possession to Him, to do with them as He wills, for He is not their natural cause as some investigators supposed, but He is their voluntary agent and acts in them as He wills."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:08.355758088Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}